rgb.photo.v1.3f724830-550e-496c-84a3-ffadeb05126f	rgb.user.v1.ffb2fde6-fba6-40aa-8bb6-55b23d5d3c1d	photo	2019-06-16 00:58:39+00	2020-03-15 18:19:04.056+00	3	7952	5304	#3f5267	{"bucket": "charliemcgrady-media-prod", "suffixes": {"lg": {"jpg": "_lg.jpg", "webp": "_lg.webp"}, "md": {"jpg": "_md.jpg", "webp": "_md.webp"}, "sm": {"jpg": "_sm.jpg", "webp": "_sm.webp"}, "xl": {"jpg": "_xl.jpg", "webp": "_xl.webp"}, "xs": {"jpg": "_xs.jpg", "webp": "_xs.webp"}, "xxl": {"jpg": "_xxl.jpg", "webp": "_xxl.webp"}, "xxs": {"jpg": "_xxs.jpg", "webp": "_xxs.webp"}}, "keyPrefix": "rgb.user.v1.ffb2fde6-fba6-40aa-8bb6-55b23d5d3c1d/rgb.photo.v1.3f724830-550e-496c-84a3-ffadeb05126f/rgb.photo.v1.3f724830-550e-496c-84a3-ffadeb05126f"}	<p>Our camp above the clouds below the Easton Glacier on Mount Baker. </p><p><br></p><p>In this picture, we are packing to leave camp for the summit. The 11:45am wake up call didn't allow for much sleep...</p>
rgb.photo.v1.9bb8a0ec-bf50-4ca8-8401-5b2d787d10ca	rgb.user.v1.ffb2fde6-fba6-40aa-8bb6-55b23d5d3c1d	photo	2019-06-15 20:43:02+00	2020-03-15 18:18:28.649+00	3	1834	2292	#717488	{"bucket": "charliemcgrady-media-prod", "suffixes": {"lg": {"jpg": "_lg.jpg", "webp": "_lg.webp"}, "md": {"jpg": "_md.jpg", "webp": "_md.webp"}, "sm": {"jpg": "_sm.jpg", "webp": "_sm.webp"}, "xl": {"jpg": "_xl.jpg", "webp": "_xl.webp"}, "xs": {"jpg": "_xs.jpg", "webp": "_xs.webp"}, "xxl": {"jpg": "_xxl.jpg", "webp": "_xxl.webp"}, "xxs": {"jpg": "_xxs.jpg", "webp": "_xxs.webp"}}, "keyPrefix": "rgb.user.v1.ffb2fde6-fba6-40aa-8bb6-55b23d5d3c1d/rgb.photo.v1.9bb8a0ec-bf50-4ca8-8401-5b2d787d10ca/rgb.photo.v1.9bb8a0ec-bf50-4ca8-8401-5b2d787d10ca"}	<p>The moon rising over Glacier Peak, taken from Mount Baker.</p><p><br></p><p>When I was a kid, I would fantasize about jumping from cloud-to-cloud like Mario. I fell back into this day dream this evening to calm my nerves before the climb.</p>
